Error [jet.DeferLeavesItsBlock]: `next` can't leave a `defer` body
  --> tests/ui/defer_next.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |             next
    |             ^^^^
 Why: A `defer` body runs as its block ends, after the block's own exit was chosen, so it can't choose another.
 Fix: Take the `next` out of the `defer` body and choose the exit in the block itself.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0509
